    effect: 'The psyber-raven gains +10 Willpower.\nIf the psyber-raven is adjacent to 2 or more creatures after Relocate is used on it, psychic powers relayed through this psyber-raven are calculated as if psy rating were increased by +1 until the end of the Overseer\'s turn.',
