    effect: 'Whenever the psyber-raven relays one of the Overseer\'s non-attacking psychic powers, it gains +5 Willpower for 1 round. Stacks.\nIf the psyber-raven\'s Willpower is 80 or more at the end of the Overseer\'s turn, it immediately heals to full. If it is already at full wounds, it grants +1 resolve to each ally in a 4-cell radius.',
