    type: 'item',
    effect: 'The psyber-raven gains +15 Willpower.\nEnemies affected by a relayed psychic power must pass an Agility resistance test or become slowed.\nIf the enemy is already slowed, it must pass an Agility resistance test with a +20 bonus or become immobilised. Targets immune to immobilised suffer warp damage equal to 5% of maximum wounds.',
